WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:03,370
Dashan, call the police

2
00:00:03,370 --> 00:00:04,370
Five thousand is not enough. I will give you ten thousand.

3
00:00:04,370 --> 00:00:05,370
Twenty thousand is fine too

4
00:00:06,370 --> 00:00:11,660
I have long disliked that old thing.

5
00:00:11,660 --> 00:00:12,660
I used to go to his store to buy things.

6
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:13,660
Still short of gold

7
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:14,660
Now I can even buy a head mask into other stores

8
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:15,660
Do all this kind of thing

9
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:18,400
Did I wake you up?

10
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:20,400
Sorry, it's okay

11
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:21,400
Anyway, in half an hour

12
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:22,400
It’s time for us to get up and knead the dough.

13
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:24,620
Then you are busy

14
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:25,620
I'll go back to sleep first
